WEBVTT

00:07:29.901 --> 00:07:33.332
And I know something about
what that kind of trauma,

00:07:33.356 --> 00:07:35.446
stress and adversity does to children.

00:07:36.913 --> 00:07:39.537
So I'm going to get clinical
with you for a moment,

00:07:39.561 --> 00:07:41.770
and I'm going to be
the professor that I am.

00:07:42.772 --> 00:07:47.044
Under prolonged and intense stress,

00:07:47.068 --> 00:07:50.818
trauma, hardship, adversity,
harsh conditions,

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:55.967
the developing brain is harmed,

00:07:55.991 --> 00:07:57.324
plain and simple.

00:07:57.998 --> 00:07:59.754
Its wiring and its architecture

00:07:59.778 --> 00:08:01.325
are damaged.